  - ToolCorrectness      vs the golden's expected_tools (only when the golden
                         states them; an explicit [] means "call no tool")
  - ArgumentCorrectness  are the arguments it passed sensible for the input
  - answer correctness   G-Eval against the golden's expected_output (if any)
  - guards (no judge)    Tool Call Budget, Repeated Tool Calls (loops)

